# Files that document the chezmoi source repository itself.
# They are not dotfiles, so without this list chezmoi would deploy them
# verbatim to the home directory (e.g. CLAUDE.md -> ~/CLAUDE.md).
#
# Patterns are matched with doublestar against the TARGET path, so a bare
# `CLAUDE.md` only matches ~/CLAUDE.md and leaves ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md
# (from dot_claude/CLAUDE.md) managed.
CLAUDE.md
README.md
nvim.log
